{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule the skies in style with the DUCKSIDE First Flight Starter Pack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 First Flight Themed Hats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airline Pilot, Fighter Jet Pilot Hat, Small Plane Pilot Hat, Navigation Lights Hat, \u201cMultitasker\u201d Hat (For ducks who do it all), \u201cBurger\u201d Hat (Because flying makes you hungry).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Cozy Nest Customisations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cPaw\u201d Nest  and \u201cPool\u201d Nest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your duck geared up for some high-flying adventures with six unique hats, two nest skin items, and show your colors with exclusive themed customisations for some of the most essential items in DUCKSIDE. This pack will make your duck the envy of the flock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the mirror at Merchant's to dress to impress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the skies!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802310?t=1756914928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802310/3443692875b8a41a9727075047b3bbd5a3559e51/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756914928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802310/0fc4edfca88b1bf91da68fe6bbcf29c41f654b39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756914928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802310/0fc4edfca88b1bf91da68fe6bbcf29c41f654b39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756914928","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p